   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## A palette from any picture\n\nTwo pictures in: **yours** (top) and a **colour source** (bottom) — a film still, a painting, a photo whose light you like. The model redraws yours in the source's palette:\n\n1. **Latent Color Match** moves the starting latent towards the source's colours.\n2. **Latent Color Guidance** holds that palette at every step while the model draws, so light and shadow are composed in it.\n3. **A1111 Color Correction** finishes on the decoded picture: colour from the source, brightness from the render.\n\n`denoise` 0.5 keeps your composition; raise it for a freer redraw. To try another look, change only the bottom picture."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
